<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Bernard I, Duke of Saxony</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1011">1011</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/11th-century">11th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Bernard I was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/duke-of-saxony">Duke of Saxony</a> from 973 to 1011, the son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hermann-billung">Hermann Billung</a>. He continued his father's role as guardian of the Billung march against the Slavic peoples east of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elbe">Elbe</a>, though the great Slavic revolt of 983 undermined German control there. He strengthened the ducal power of the Billung family in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saxony">Saxony</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/bernard-i-duke-of-saxony.jpg" alt="Bernard I, Duke of Saxony" width="320" height="508" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Johann Agricola († 1590) · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BernhardISachsen.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
